00:55:57,934 --> 00:56:00,256
The test is just repeating the implementation.

768
00:56:00,558 --> 00:56:10,500
It's not actually like what you want from your test is you want a big chunk of code that I'm gonna call a module, and you want that module to basically be hidden from the tests.

769
00:56:11,022 --> 00:56:24,644
The stuff inside the module is hidden from the tests, because that means it can just test it via a very narrow little sort of entry point to that module, and it means that you can change everything inside that module without needing to alter the tests.

